tags: event

= Nitti II Government Collapses!

The current governing coalition has collapsed once more in less than a month, primarily due to Nitti's inability to control the dissent of the coalition. He is succeeded by Giovanni Giolitti of the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#0047AB;">[+ ul_full_name +]</span>, and is joined by the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#FFC0CB;">PSRI</span> once more, alongside the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#1E99C5;">[+ ds_name +]</span>.
